#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "The block edition of Philosophy. A masonry blog theme built for the Site Editor: every template, header, footer and section is blocks, and the design system lives in theme.json. Philosophy Blocks installs alongside the classic Philosophy theme, so a site can move across when it suits and switch back if it does not."
